---
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';
import { waLink } from '../../lib/whatsapp';
---

<section class="cta-final">
    <div class="cta-final__inner">
        <h2>Vamos cuidar do seu sorriso?</h2>
        <p>O primeiro passo é uma avaliação sem pressa, com tudo explicado. Atendimento humanizado no Fátima, em Fortaleza.</p>
        <div>
            <a href={waLink('agendar')} data-cta="cta-final"
                target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-cta">
                <Icon name="mdi:whatsapp" />
                Agendar pelo WhatsApp
            </a>
        </div>
        <div class="cta-final__badges">
            <span class="cta-final__badge"><Icon name="solar:shield-check-bold" /> Atendimento Humanizado</span>
            <span class="cta-final__badge"><Icon name="solar:star-bold" /> 5,0 no Google</span>
            <span class="cta-final__badge"><Icon name="solar:diploma-verified-bold" /> CRO CE 16735</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
/* ── CTA FINAL ── */
.cta-final {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-bordo-dark) 0%, var(--color-bordo) 100%);
    text-align: center; padding: 4rem var(--space-lg);
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
}
.cta-final::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0.07) 0%, transparent 60%);
    pointer-events: none;
}
.cta-final__inner { position: relative; z-index: 2; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }
.cta-final h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    color: white; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.2;
}
.cta-final p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; line-height: 1.5; }

.cta-final__badges { display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
.cta-final__badge {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
    font-size: 0.8rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); font-weight: 500;
}
.cta-final__badge .icon { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); }
</style>
